    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cImpressive visuals and responsive gameplay make this a must have.\u201d<br>Road to VR<br><br>\u201cTactera is different, not only because it\u2019s simplified real time strategy, not only because it automates a lot of the more mediocre parts of the genre, not only because it\u2019s a faster paced tactical game, but because it\u2019s designed for Virtual Reality from the ground up.\u201d<br>VR Perception<br><br>\u201cTactera is a wonderful tactical game that is easy to learn and challenging to master.\u201d<br>Mobile VR Daily<br>",
